                                                "sense_id": "d40e0f0d-bc02-3024-9281-7af2e81208ce",
                                                "text": "I sometimes hold it half a sin\n⁠To put in words the grief I feel;\n⁠For words, like Nature, half reveal\nAnd half conceal the Soul within."
